{"ts":"2026-10-02T14:40:25.379Z","runId":"08a2f42c-4e80-4306-8628-d00f8a8b486d","pipelineId":"full","event":"session_update","data":{"nodeId":"plan","agent":"Vibe Sandbox","data":{"content":{"text":"```xml\n<proposed_plan>\n<interview_state>ready</interview_state>\n\n## Approved decisions\n\n- **Error message format**: `Unable to <action>: [stderr] <trimmed_stderr>\\n[stdout] <trimmed_stdout>` when both streams are non-empty (stderr first, then stdout). If only stderr is non-empty: `Unable to <action>: [stderr] <trimmed_stderr>`. If only stdout is non-empty: `Unable to <action>: [stdout] <trimmed_stdout>`. If both are empty: `Unable to <action>: exit code N` (fallback with exit code).\n- **Trimming**: Trim both stderr and stdout. Only include non-empty streams in the message.\n- **Success behavior**: Unchanged (no modification to success cases).\n- **Private interfaces**: Preserve all `private/interfaces` without modification.\n- **Testing**: Five public tests in `acp-sandbox/test/runtime.test.ts` using `runCodex` with `fakeExecutor`/`sandboxScenario`. Inject `SubprocessResult` from real `sbx create` (not `create --help`). Test cases: both streams, stderr only, stdout only, empty streams, success.\n- **Test constraints**: Never use `assertSuccess`/`requireSuccess` directly or `any`. Do not modify visibility.\n- **Dependencies**: No new dependencies, no changes to `package.json`/`package-lock.json`.\n- **Execution**: Fresh sandbox via `npm ci` at ROOT, then `npm test` at ROOT of the monorepo.\n- **File updates**: Update existing affected test expectations.\n- **Output**: No ADR, no glossary, no `.scratch` files. One vertical ticket.\n- **Spec constraints**: T01 returns real JSON contract `acp.implementation-result/v1`. JSON review for `acp.verification-report/v1`.\n- **Pipeline**: Full completion required.\n</proposed_plan>\n```","type":"text"},"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk"}}}
